### 1) Start the backend locally
# Set env vars in terminal or use .env.local from .env.example.

# 2) Register a new user
POST http://localhost:5032/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "tester@example.com",
  "password": "StrongPassword123!"
}

### 3) Login with the user and copy the token
POST http://localhost:5032/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "tester@example.com",
  "password": "StrongPassword123!"
}

### 4) Call a protected endpoint with the returned JWT
GET http://localhost:5032/api/auth/me
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}
